# DataLab · only the static game goes to Vercel (the backend lives in Supabase)
# Patterns follow .gitignore rules: WITHOUT a leading "/" a name matches at ANY depth.
# "supabase/" used to strip assets/js/supabase/config.js from the deploy, so the published game had
# no Supabase URL/key and the login stopped at "Servidor indisponível". Keep these anchored to the root.
/supabase/
/.env
/.env.*
/PROXIMOS-PASSOS.txt
/DESIGN-x.ai.md
/tests/
# DEV-AUTOPLAY: assets/js/dev/ vai para o deploy; no site o botão Auto só carrega com ?dev=1 (ver demo.js)
